    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The University is set to launch TEACH - a pioneering programme aimed at ensuring excellence in teaching and learning across AKU's six campuses. The move follows the  accreditation of TEACH by Advance HE , a global body committed to fostering the highest standards in teaching, during a joint event in London.",
